{"created": "2020-07-08T12:21:58.871545+00:00", "modified": "2020-12-14T17:58:22.484963+00:00", "id": 3935687, "conceptrecid": "3935686", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.3935686", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "metadata": {"title": "Supraglacial debris temperature measurements from Ngozumpa Glacier, Nepal (2001\u20132002)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "publication_date": "2020-07-08", "description": "<p>Supraglacial debris temperature measurements from a site 1.5 km from the terminus of&nbsp;Ngozumpa Glacier, Nepal, collected between 13 November 2001 and 12 October 2002. Debris temperatures were measured every 30 minutes at six thermistors within the debris layer at&nbsp;depths of&nbsp;0.0 m, 0.22 m, 0.33 m, 0.45 m, 0.65 m and&nbsp;0.77 m from the debris surface. The estimated thickness of the debris layer at this site was 2.20 m.</p>\n\n<p>Measurements were made using&nbsp;Gemini thermistors and Tinytag Plus TGP-0073 loggers with a stated accuracy of &plusmn;0.3&deg;C at 0&deg;C.</p>\n\n<p>These data were first presented in:&nbsp;Nicholson L and Benn DI (2013) Properties of natural supraglacial debris in relation to modelling sub\u2010debris ice ablation. <em>Earth Surface&nbsp;Processes and&nbsp;Landforms</em> 38(5), 490&ndash;501 (doi:10.1002/esp.3299)</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"wayback1996-RTmodal\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n&times;\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Nicholson, Lindsey", "affiliation": "University of Innsbruck", "orcid": "0000-0003-0430-7950"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"issue": "5", "pages": "490\u2013501", "title": "Earth Surface\u00a0Processes and\u00a0Landforms", "volume": "38"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "iacswgondcgs"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "3935686"}}]}}, "title": "Supraglacial debris temperature measurements from Ngozumpa Glacier, Nepal (2001\u20132002)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3935687", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3935687?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.3935687", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935686", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3935686", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3935686", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.3935686", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:3935687/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:3935687/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/3935687/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/3935687/file-modifi